seh ke har ranj o bala tune shikwa na kiya<br>
tujh sa sabir na huwa<br>
ya hussain ya hussain ya hussain<br>
<br>
1. ran mein jab mare gaye zainab e muztar ke pisar<br>
dekh kar lashon ko yeh kehti thi binte hyder<br>
karti hoon shukr-e-khuda aur yeh hai meri dua<br>
bhai bach jaye mera….<br>
<br>
2.qatl abbas huwe toot gayi teri kamar<br>
aur tanhayi ka shidat se huwa dil pa asar<br>
aayi ran se jo sada tune alaan kaha<br>
aye imam-e-do sara….<br>
<br>
3.ran se awaaz jab ayi hai ali akber ki<br>
youn laga jaise tere dil pa lagi hai barchi<br>
noor ankhon ka gaya soojta kuch bhi na tha<br>
kaise laasha utha ….<br>
<br>
4. teer asghar ke gale se jo nikala tune<br>
haye kis dil se bhala dil ko sambhala tune<br>
khoon chullu mein liya aur chehre pa mala<br>
surkhuru deen huwa….<br>
<br>
5.deen par waqt jab aya paye nusrath nikli<br>
ran mein quran-e-shahadat ki har aayat nikli<br>
tera ghar baar luta koi baqi na bacha<br>
milgayi deen ko baqa<br>
<br>
6. tune ashoor ko bachoun ka kiya hai matam<br>
kaun batlayega jo tha tere dil ka aalam<br>
aye shahinshah huda dekh kar haal tera<br>
roti hain karbobala<br>
<br>
7. na koi monis-o-yawar hai na koi hamdam<br>
kufa-o-shaam ki rahoun mein hain be parda haram<br>
koi baaqi na raha karne imdaad zara<br>
kaun ayega bhala<br>
<br>
8.qatl par tere basas naala-o-afghan ayi<br>
khoon mein doobi huwi shaam-e-ghareeban ayi<br>
maal-o-asbab luta tera ghar jalta raha<br>
roti hai aal-e-aba<br>
<br>
9. baad tere yahi zainab ne manazir dekhe<br>
baazu rasi mein bandhe pusht pa dure bhi lage<br>
har sitam dhaya gaya taaziyane bhi laga<br>
chin gayi sar se rida<br>
<br>
10. haye maqtal se teri laash uthayi na gayi<br>
dil-e-sajjad se yeh baat bhulayi na gayi<br>
sadma dil par wo huwa yaad kar kar ke sada<br>
tujh ko rota hi raha<br>
<br>
11. istarha itrat-e-athar ko lejaya gaya<br>
sab ke baazu the bandhe aur sakina ka gala<br>
jo sitam dhaya gaya kaise likhon mein bhala<br>
kyun falak gir na pada<br>
<br>
12. qalb-e-zaianb ne is ehsaas ko nashtar jaana<br>
haye jab umme habiba ne nahi pehchana<br>
haal zainab ka yeh tha gham se dil baith gaya<br>
dil se nikli yeh sada<br>
<br>
13. aayi darbar mein jab aale rasool-e-dosara<br>
saat sou kursi nasheeno sed tha darbar bhara<br>
daaqela jab ke huwa kya sitam tooth gaya<br>
ek qayamat thi bapa<br>
<br>
14. tere lab haye mubarak pa thi zalim ki chadi<br>
haye kis dil se bahan ne yeh aziyat dekhi<br>
band ankoun ko kiya jab ke yeh zulm huwa<br>
hil gayi arz-o-sama<br>
<br>
15. be sabab khaye sakina ne tamache itne<br>
phool se hogaye rukhsar bhi neele neele<br>
tune aye shahe huda - noke naize se bhala<br>
yeh bhi dekha hoga<br>
<br>
16. dil mein armaa tha sakina ke jo ghar jaane ke<br>
jab bhi zindan ke darwaze se taayer guzra<br>
puchti thi yeh sada aye phuphi bolo zara<br>
honge kis waqt reha<br>
<br>
17. aye ali akber-e-man noor do chashman-e-pedar<br>
ze ghamat posht pedar kham shodeh ayy noor nazar<br>
sineyeh chaak tora gar be binte laillah<br>
mee kunath aho buka<br>
<br>
18. yek taraf ahle haram suwe degar dukhtar-e-toh<br>
safre kufe-o-shaam ast-o-ro nayze sareto<br>
ayy shaheed-e-karbala bikan wa tanha<br>
ya abaab dillah<br>
<br>
19. gule gulzar e harm ayy ali asghar pisaram<br>
manchigone qabar-e-margetu qaime bee baram<br>
tifleman halk tohra zalimoo-o- aada<br>
pare kardanze jafa<br>
<br>
20. nouha yeh jab bhi padhe jayega razvi-o-nazar<br>
quld se denge duaein tumhe shah ki madar<br>
khoob nouha yeh kaha zikr bekas ka kiya<br>
roke pursa bhi diya